    (h.req "01a1b49c-adaf-7404-bafb-35d309428831"
      "Twenty-one answers outside the protocol are each refused as malformed. Ten are for a publish, including a wrong magic, a wrong version and a nonzero reserved field. Eleven are for a take, including a wrong magic, a wrong version, a failure carrying a count and a consistent sample longer than the buffer. Each poisons the session and returns both loans."
      "Write and judge the Zenoh service client adapter"
