      }) with { supersedes = { "01a18328-7a0d-7507-9850-cbbb0baae9ca"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adaf-7404-bafb-35d7abeede03"
      "`components/lib/src/lib.rs` holds the export of the adapter once, directly under the `component-runtime` feature attribute. Fourteen corrupted files are each refused. They remove the line or change the attribute. They also comment it out, wrap it in a block comment or an inline module, make it private or double it."
      "Write and judge the Zenoh service client adapter"
      {
        h.observedWhere "cases-observed" "zenoh_service_client_io_check" { h.count "casesObserved" 73; } "The checker counts 31 lines that the Rust test printed. They are loan checks, requests, slices, statuses, samples and teardowns. It also counts 42 refusals by name and class. The total is 73. The count is exact, and it is reported only after the schema's judge and the wire records' judge pass.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a18328-7a0d-7507-9850-cbbb0baae9ca"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adaf-7404-bafb-35d82f12dafb"
      "The slice first runs the client schema's judge, with its 24 facts and 80 controls. It then runs the wire records' judge, with its 17 cases and 76 controls. It also runs the wire records' Rust test. It compares the committed client constants and wire records with their renderers before it runs the adapter's Rust. A stale constant that the adapter and its stand-in share is therefore refused."
      "Write and judge the Zenoh service client adapter"
      {
        h.observedWhere "cases-observed" "zenoh_service_client_io_check" { h.count "casesObserved" 73; } "The checker counts 31 lines that the Rust test printed. They are loan checks, requests, slices, statuses, samples and teardowns. It also counts 42 refusals by name and class. The total is 73. The count is exact, and it is reported only after the schema's judge and the wire records' judge pass.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a18328-7a0d-7507-9850-cbbb0baae9ca"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adaf-7404-bafb-35d9b1c27aa7"
      "The judge refuses 170 corruptions before it runs any Rust. They are 153 transcripts, 3 corrupted request layouts and 14 corrupted exports of the adapter."
      "Write and judge the Zenoh service client adapter"
      {
        h.observedWhere "controls-refused" "zenoh_service_client_io_check" { h.count "negativeControlsRefused" 170; } "The checker refuses exactly 170 corruptions before it runs any Rust. They are 153 transcripts, 3 corrupted request layouts and 14 corrupted exports. Each corrupted layout is run through the judge with the honest transcript. A dropped or invented control changes the count and re-admits the item.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a18328-7a0d-7507-9850-cbbb0baae9ca"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adaf-7404-bafb-35dab44bf9d4"
      "`just zenoh_service_client_io_check` exits zero and reports its observations through the gate adapter."
      "Write and judge the Zenoh service client adapter"
      {
        h.observedWhere "recipe-passed" "zenoh_service_client_io_check" h.noPredicates "The gate adapter reports the recipe's exit code, so the checker cannot vouch for itself. The recipe fails until the adapter lands.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a18328-7a0d-7507-9850-cbbb0baae9ca"; }; };
    -- legacy 01a186d0-03db-7232-a90f-70f0750a5793 (done): Judge the Zenoh service client adapter failed-attach abort
    -- When an attach fails after both loans arrived, the Zenoh service client adapter ends the session the
    -- service holds. Review of the adapter found this gap twice. The first version left the session open.
    -- The first fix sent the abort before it read the attach answer, and a blocking send could turn that
    -- into a deadlock. Only an assert-only test grades the fixed behavior, and no judge reads it. This
    -- item makes the judge grade it. A later change that drops the abort or reorders it is then refused.
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adbd-759e-bfba-a00e487ee8ec"
      "Four attaches fail after the service answered. They are an unformatted ring, one buffer for both loans, no rows and too many rows. Each returns malformed. Each sends the attach request and then one abort request of the 32 bytes the layout gives. Each returns both loans before the abort is sent, once each, and leaves no answer unread. The test prints the capability slot of each returned loan, so a slot returned twice while the other leaks is seen."
      "Judge the Zenoh service client adapter failed-attach abort"
      {
        h.observedWhere "cases-observed" "zenoh_service_client_abort_check" { h.count "casesObserved" 9; } "The checker counts 8 failed-attach lines and one closing line that the Rust test printed. The 8 each name an error the adapter returned, so they are the refusals. The total is 9. The count is exact, and it is reported only after the judge accepted every line against independent bytes and ordering.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a186d0-03db-7232-a90f-70f0750a5793"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adbd-759e-bfba-a00fcdfc16cb"
      "Five of the six cases that send an abort have two scripted answers unread when the attach goes out. They have one unread when the abort goes out. The service sends its attach answer with a send that blocks until it is received, so an abort sent first could wait forever."
      "Judge the Zenoh service client adapter failed-attach abort"
      {
        h.observedWhere "cases-observed" "zenoh_service_client_abort_check" { h.count "casesObserved" 9; } "The checker counts 8 failed-attach lines and one closing line that the Rust test printed. The 8 each name an error the adapter returned, so they are the refusals. The total is 9. The count is exact, and it is reported only after the judge accepted every line against independent bytes and ordering.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a186d0-03db-7232-a90f-70f0750a5793"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-adbd-759e-bfba-a01051eae274"
      "An abort that is not acknowledged and an abort that is acknowledged as another operation each return malformed, the attach error. Both loans are back before the abort. When the unacknowledged abort goes out, the attach answer is already read and no answer is unread."
