      }) with { supersedes = { "01a186d0-03db-7232-a90f-70f0750a5793"; }; };
  }) with {
    nonGoals = {
      "Generated encoders and decoders for the layouts. The schema has no `gen_rust.zt`, which is product code. A later planning step owns the wire records and their bindings.";
      "The client library, the grants path, the service component and a booted composition. Later items own them.";
      "A holder with a sample larger than 4080 bytes. The grants contract allows larger samples and this version does not serve them.";
      "A request that names a key, a topic or a type.";
      "Any product change in the planning PR.";
      "The client adapter, the grants path, the service component and a booted composition. Other items own them.";
      "A change to `contracts/zenoh-service-client/v1`. The schema is landed and its item is done. This item reads it.";
      "A validator for the semantics of a record, such as which operation may carry which flag. The adapter owns it.";
      "A `gen_rust.zt` renderer. It is product code, and a planning PR cannot carry it. The generator is a script, as the grants and the client constants are.";
      "The service component, the grants path and a booted composition. Other items own them, and no service exists to attach to.";
      "Notifications, deadlines and timers. The adapter polls a bounded number of times, and a completion that does not arrive is lost.";
      "A sample larger than 4080 bytes. The protocol does not carry one.";
      "More than one outstanding request. The ring holds four slots and the adapter uses one.";
      "A change to the adapter's behavior. The behavior landed in the adapter item, and this item grades it.";
      "The real service. The test plays the service with a scripted stand-in, so what the real service does with an abort is not graded.";
      "An attach that has received only one loan. The adapter sends no abort there, and the item does not claim that this is right.";
      "A change to `contracts/zenoh-service-client/v1`.";
    };
  };

